  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of an Enhanced Production and Risk Management in Agriculture Integrated Decision Support System (EPRiMA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to help increase the resilience of the agriculture sector against multiple threats by allowing key actors in the Department of Agriculture to make more effective and timely decisions through comprehensive and near real-time access to crop production and risk and damage assessment information and tools.</narrative>
  </description>
